  "details": "VRChat sometimes launches with the microphone missing. \n\nThis issue can happen when I'm using Beats Fit Pro or Beats Solo Buds.\n\nI’m not sure about the exact conditions under which it occurs, but it seems to occur when Bluetooth auto-connection via Apple’s iCloud is enabled, and the earphones were connected to another Apple device before launching VRChat.\n\nHowever, since I don’t usually use non-Apple/Beats Bluetooth earphones, I haven’t been able to confirm whether the issue can be reproduced with other brands.\n\nDevice: iPad Pro (11-inch, 3rd Gen)",
